      },
      "message": "[FLINK-18071][coordination] (part 6) Communication from Coordinators to Tasks happens through gateways that are scoped to a single execution attempt.\n\nThat way the events have a well specified target, no matter how much the actual sending is delayed due to race\nconditions.\n\nThis also un-ignores the CoordinatorEventsExactlyOnceITCase that now runs stable with this fix.",
